OL,3,GNEWSANew A47 bridge named in honour of
OL,4,A'heroic' campaigner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bridge built as part of a #90m
OL,7,Fproject to dual a major stretch of the
OL,8,FA47 has been named after a "heroic"
OL,9,Fcampaigner for road safety.
OL,11,FThe new bridge - linking two Norfolk
OL,12,Fvillages - has been officially named
OL,13,FKnights Bridge after Valerie Knights,
OL,14,Fof North Burlingham, who used to come
OL,15,Fto the aid of motorists involved in
OL,16,Fcollisions on the road.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
