OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew A47 bridge named in honour of
OL,4,A'heroic' campaigner
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bridge is part of works on a
OL,7,F2.6-mile (4.2km) stretch of the A47,
OL,8,Freplacing the existing single-lane
OL,9,Fsection between Blofield and North
OL,10,FBurlingham east of Norwich with a dual
OL,11,Fcarriageway.
OL,13,FKnights' daughter, Carol Charles, was
OL,14,Fat the bridge opening and said her
OL,15,Fmother would "be very proud" the bridge
OL,16,Fwas named after her.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
